286
00:16:17,181 --> 00:16:20,180
This was the beginning of the age of the factory limousine,

287
00:16:20,181 --> 00:16:24,180
a vehicle whose chassis and body would be built under one roof,

288
00:16:24,181 --> 00:16:28,680
the factory roof. The Cadillac Series 75,

289
00:16:28,681 --> 00:16:31,680
