00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:11,480
Hard to coax around corners and almost impossible to park.

339
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:15,660
But despite the vehicle's imposing size,

340
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,420
the manufacture and sale of limousines

341
00:19:18,421 --> 00:19:20,440
is a surprisingly small business.

342
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:24,660
As the U.S. economy bubbled in the late 1990s,

343
00:19:24,661 --> 00:19:29,040
So did the sale of limousines, peaking at a mere 9,000 vehicles

