00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:34,240
before falling to 4,000 in 2001.

345
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:37,940
Right now, we are in a stretched Cadillac limousine.

346
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:40,180
This is a 2003 model.

347
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:43,220
And it was stretched by the largest coach builder

