00:22:39,061 --> 00:22:41,900
and added three feet to it, giving birth to what is now

404
00:22:41,901 --> 00:22:44,900
the dominant limousine on the road, the stretch.

405
00:22:44,901 --> 00:22:47,900
Their car included modifications such as permanent rear-facing

406
00:22:47,901 --> 00:22:52,900
seating, dual air conditioning for front and rear compartments,

407
00:22:52,901 --> 00:22:56,900
many televisions and mobile phones that are considered standard

408
00:22:56,901 --> 00:22:59,900
on contemporary stretch limousines.

409
00:22:59,901 --> 00:23:04,900
In conjunction with Ford, Lehman Peterson made 500 cars

410
00:23:04,901 --> 00:23:07,900
before a design change in the Continental model caused a

411
00:23:07,901 --> 00:23:11,900
contractual and warranty issue with Ford that forced the

412
00:23:11,901 --> 00:23:15,900
to production in 1970.

413
00:23:15,901 --> 00:23:18,900
The stretch limousines of today are still made the old-fashioned

414
00:23:18,901 --> 00:23:23,900
way, by cutting a sedan in two.

415
00:23:23,901 --> 00:23:25,900
But wait a second.

416
00:23:25,901 --> 00:23:28,900
Before chopping the body, some decisions have to be made.

417
00:23:28,901 --> 00:23:32,900
And that's where Crystal Enterprises comes into the picture.

418
00:23:36,900 --> 00:23:37,900
I'd build what you want.

419
00:23:37,901 --> 00:23:38,900
Do you want leather?

