00:24:11,181 --> 00:24:14,260
We probably have a little over 400 men that are working on the

430
00:24:14,261 --> 00:24:16,060
conversion going through the process.

431
00:24:16,061 --> 00:24:19,760
It takes 12 days from start to finish.

432
00:24:19,761 --> 00:24:22,200
Before taking the saw to the car, workers

433
00:24:22,201 --> 00:24:25,600
